    "detailed_description": "Minimalist Farm Tycoon is a resource management game. Starting with a failing farm at hand, your job is to turn it profitable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838600/extras/df1d3c4243c23897355bc8ff03df0978.avif?t=1720243101\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Connect buildings and resources to create production chains.<br></li><li> Grow your crops and raise livestock. Sell them for a profit or use them in your factories.<br></li><li> Build factories to produce your own goods using resources from the market or your own farm.<br></li><li> Research to unlock upgrades and buildings.<br></li><li> Optimize your production for maximum profits. Your transactions effect the economy.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Minimalist Farm Tycoon is a resource management game. Starting with a failing farm at hand, your job is to turn it profitable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838600/extras/df1d3c4243c23897355bc8ff03df0978.avif?t=1720243101\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Connect buildings and resources to create production chains.<br></li><li> Grow your crops and raise livestock. Sell them for a profit or use them in your factories.<br></li><li> Build factories to produce your own goods using resources from the market or your own farm.<br></li><li> Research to unlock upgrades and buildings.<br></li><li> Optimize your production for maximum profits. Your transactions effect the economy.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Minimalist Farm Tycoon is a resource management game. Grow crops, raise livestock, research upgrades, build factories and produce goods. Turn a failing farm into a profitable business.",
